@startuml sd_us204
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US204 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Backoffice Operator" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of aircraft-maintenance" as EAM
box "aircraft-maintenance-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "AircraftModelController" as AircraftModelController
participant "GetTopUtilizedModelsUseCase" as GetTopUtilizedModelsUseCase
database "own database" as DBAM
end box
collections "peer replicas\naircraft-maintenance-m" as PAM
== GET /api/aircraftModels/top-utilized ==
Actor -> EAM : GET /api/aircraftModels/top-utilized\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> AircraftModelController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AircraftModelController -> GetTopUtilizedModelsUseCase : execute(...)
GetTopUtilizedModelsUseCase -> DBAM : own aircraft
GetTopUtilizedModelsUseCase -> PAM : GET /internal/replicas/aircrafts\n(every peer in parallel)
PAM --> GetTopUtilizedModelsUseCase : their aircraft
GetTopUtilizedModelsUseCase -> DBAM : own copies of the flights (sent by flight-ops)
GetTopUtilizedModelsUseCase -> PAM : GET /internal/replicas/flight-copies\n(every peer in parallel)
PAM --> GetTopUtilizedModelsUseCase : their copies of the flights (sent by flight-ops)
GetTopUtilizedModelsUseCase -> GetTopUtilizedModelsUseCase : keep the latest change of each record,\nleave out deleted ones; filter, compute, sort, page
GetTopUtilizedModelsUseCase --> AircraftModelController : result
AircraftModelController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id; X-Partial-Result if both holders of a record were unreachable)
@enduml
